import ZInQKernel.Contrib.RC53Assist.HodgeLatticeIdeal.NonVacuity

/-!
# The Hodge-lattice ideal dictionary: all modules

* `Coordinates`: exact coefficients, uniqueness, finiteness, and index transport in an `L`-line.
* `ModelLattice`: the unchanged integral cotangent lattice and its first determinant lattice;
  the rank-one specialization of the existing Hodge-lattice proof.
* `Fractional`: a nonzero fractional ideal and the original section-index norm identity.
* `Binding`: specialization to the actual evaluated invariant differential.
* `NonVacuity`: rational examples, genuine fractional coefficients, and orientation checks.
-/
